    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-10-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第10题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-10",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25四川）甲、乙两条生产线生产同一种产品，且甲的效率是乙的1.5倍，现接到A、B两个订单。已知甲完成A订单和乙完成B订单均需要8小时，问甲完成B订单的用时比乙完成A订单的用时少多长时间？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "6小时"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "6小时40分"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "7小时20分"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "8小时"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          61
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          55
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-10-p061.webp",
            "alt": "工程问题 · 实战精刷10 · 讲义第55页",
            "pdfPage": 61
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-10-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-10",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们把甲、乙效率设为3、2。甲8小时完成A，所以A量24；乙8小时完成B，所以B量16。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "甲完成B用16/3小时，乙完成A用24/2＝12小时。两者相差12－16/3＝20/3小时，也就是6小时40分钟，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "效率比先赋值，订单量分别由各自已知工时确定，再交叉计算。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
